cing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.70<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 8, 2010<br/>Winter Update 2010</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Event</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20150622194653&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demon_Infant_94b1cf.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a demon infant.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 12.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Ugiugi!</li><li>Psht!The little beast is still sleeping!</li><li>Me wanna see house of saaantaaa!</li><li>Whoooo! Santa nize houz! Me will be good lil demon ziz year.</li><li>Me wanna mouldy cheeeeze!</li><li>&lt;FART&gt; Oopsi! Hehe!</li><li>Me wanna eat firefly!</li><li>&lt;KNARSH&gt; Hmmnjamjamjam!</li><li>Me wanna zee emperor of lil' dwarfz!</li><li>Oooh! Look! He iz almozt az lil' az me!!</li><li>Me wanna lick some snooow!</li><li>Ziz was cold!</li><li>UHH! Me zeazick! &lt;vomits&gt; Zoooory!</li><li>Muuuhaaahaa! Me wanna my pacifier!</li><li>WHOMP</li><li>Me wanna see draaagons isle! Where old draaagons go.</li><li>Phew! Dead draagoon stinky like demonic diapers after week!</li><li>Me wanna play in zaaand! Finding treazure, building caztlez!</li><li>Bah! Me findz no-ting fun! Booooring!</li><li>Me wanna kizz draaaagooon!</li><li>Draagooon hot kizzer! Hehehe!</li><li>Me wanna kizz fire devil!</li><li>He mean an nazty! Me wanna become like him one day!</li><li>SSSMACK</li><li>Me wanna make muzic! Me wanna play waaaahdrum!</li><li>WOOOMBA! WHOMMEL! WOOOOMBABABA!</li><li>Meee very hungry! Me wanna eat black sheep!</li><li>MAAEE...urkks &lt;CHOMP&gt;</li><li>Me stinky! Me needs lava bath</li><li>YIPIE! This was hot!</li><li>Me wanna eat many, many worms!</li><li>Hmmm! Tis waz good!</li><li>Waaah! Me ztomach hurtz! Waaah! Make it better! Get out whatz hurtz zomehow!</li><li>Glglgl!</li><li>BUURRRP! Uhh! Iz much better now!</li><li>The baby seems pleased. Return it to it's mother.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Depends on mood it has different description.<br/>\nWith tears: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiagreen\">The little demon is awake.</span> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Demon Infant (Tears)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demon_Infant_Tears_320598.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><br/> \nWith smile and closed eyes: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiagreen\">The little demon is sleeping.</span> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Demon Infant (Smile)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demon_Infant_Smile_6d14c7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><br/> \nWith big smile and opened eyes: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiagreen\">The little demon looks greedy.</span> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Demon Infant (Euphoric)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demon_Infant_Euphoric_a01c71.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><br/> \nWith hearts near face: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiagreen\">The little demon wants to kiss.</span> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Demon Infant (Kiss)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demon_Infant_Kiss_77236c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><br/>\nWith smile and opened eyes: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiagreen\">The little demon is pleased.</span> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Demon Infant (Happy)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demon_Infant_Happy_8a3cea.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><br/><br/><b>WARNING:</b> If you activate it after the event ends, the little demon <b>will disappear</b>: <span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">The baby returned to its mother.</span>\n</p><p>It's part of <a href=\"#/quest/demons-lullaby\">Demon's Lullaby</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Quests\">World Quest</a>. During this time you have to make it happy. To get one, you may talk to <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Mother\">Demon Mother</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"